    <briefdescription>
<para>This pass calculates the liveness information for each basic block in a function and attaches the register live-out information to a patchpoint intrinsic if present. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This pass can be disabled via the -enable-patchpoint-liveness=false flag. The pass skips functions that don&apos;t have any patchpoint intrinsics. The information provided by this pass is optional and not required by the aformentioned intrinsic to function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
